    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. AI Repurposing\nOne Claude Sonnet 4.5 call with a strict JSON output parser returns 5 platform-native drafts + 5 title variants in a single pass. Single call = reliable, fast, cheap, and retryable.",
        "height": 792,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "baf1ab13-836a-4ef9-8582-115b4778f534",
