    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Deliver\nEach draft is saved to a Notion review database, then a Slack notification pings your review channel with the page link.\n\n### Notion setup (required)\nCreate a database with these exact property names:\n- Title (type: Title)\n- Status (type: Select — options: Draft, Review, Published)\n- Content Type (type: Select — options: YouTube Video, Blog Post, Podcast Episode, Other)\n- Source URL (type: URL)\n- Audience (type: Text)\n- Summary (type: Text)\n- LinkedIn Post (type: Text)\n- X Thread (type: Text)\n- Newsletter (type: Text)\n- YouTube Short (type: Text)\n- Instagram Caption (type: Text)\n- Title Variants (type: Text)\n\nThen paste the database ID into the Notion node and set your Slack channel on the Notify node.",
        "height": 792,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ede0eb27-0e70-4a58-b546-de77644a509a",
